  <!-- EN: Trade request quest weight: {0} -->
  <BTG_Settings_TradeRequestQuestWeight>取引依頼クエストの重み: {0}</BTG_Settings_TradeRequestQuestWeight>
  <!-- EN: How often the storyteller offers the guild's shuttle trade request quest, weighed against every other quest it could pick.\nSet to 0 to stop the quest being offered at all. -->
  <BTG_Settings_TradeRequestQuestWeightDesc>ストーリーテラーがギルドのシャトルによる取引依頼クエストを提示する頻度を,他のあらゆる候補クエストと比較してどれだけ重視するかを決めます.\n0に設定すると,このクエストは一切提示されなくなります.</BTG_Settings_TradeRequestQuestWeightDesc>
  <!-- EN: Smuggler's den quest weight: {0} -->
  <BTG_Settings_SmugglersDenQuestWeight>密輸業者の巣窟クエストの重み: {0}</BTG_Settings_SmugglersDenQuestWeight>
  <!-- EN: How often the storyteller offers the smuggler's den quest, weighed against every other quest it could pick.\nSet to 0 to stop the quest being offered at all. -->
  <BTG_Settings_SmugglersDenQuestWeightDesc>ストーリーテラーが密輸業者の巣窟クエストを提示する頻度を,他のあらゆる候補クエストと比較してどれだけ重視するかを決めます.\n0に設定すると,このクエストは一切提示されなくなります.</BTG_Settings_SmugglersDenQuestWeightDesc>

  <!-- ========== MOD SETTINGS: MOD NAME ========== -->
  <!-- Deliberately left as the Latin brand name. -->
  <!-- EN: Better Traders Guild -->
  <BTG_Settings_ModName>商人ギルド拡張MOD</BTG_Settings_ModName>

  <!-- ========== DEFENDER RESUPPLY ========== -->
  <!-- EN: The garrison's distress call has drawn a response. -->
  <BTG_ResupplyDropArrived>駐屯部隊の救援要請に応答がありました.</BTG_ResupplyDropArrived>

  <!-- ========== MOD SETTINGS: DEFENDER RESUPPLY ========== -->
  <!-- "通信機" is Core ja's CommsConsole.label; "非常用食品" its MealSurvivalPack.label. -->
  <!-- EN: Resupply meals per defender: {0} -->
  <BTG_Settings_ResupplyMealsPerDefender>防衛部隊1人あたりの補給食料: {0}</BTG_Settings_ResupplyMealsPerDefender>
  <!-- EN: When starving defenders have exhausted all food inside the structure, they use a comms console to call in a survival-meal cargo pod: this many meals per surviving defender.\nSet to 0 to disable resupply calls entirely. At most one drop lands per map every 6 hours.\nRequires entrenched defender AI. Applies to settlements and the smuggler's den alike. -->
  <BTG_Settings_ResupplyMealsPerDefenderDesc>構造物内の食料をすべて使い果たして飢えた防衛部隊は,通信機を使って非常用食品を積んだ貨物ポッドを呼び寄せます.この値は,生存している防衛部隊1人あたりの数です.\n0に設定すると,補給の要請自体を完全に無効にします.投下は1マップにつき6時間ごとに最大1回です.\n籠城型の防衛AIが必要です.入植地にも密輸業者の巣窟にも適用されます.</BTG_Settings_ResupplyMealsPerDefenderDesc>
  <!-- Vanilla ja has no {0}h string; units attach tight throughout, so the English form
       is kept as-is. -->
  <!-- EN: Call in reinforcements -->
  <BTG_Settings_ResupplyTriggersRaid>増援を要請する</BTG_Settings_ResupplyTriggersRaid>
  <!-- EN: When a resupply call succeeds, also summon a drop-pod raid of the garrison faction's reinforcements to hunt your pawns. They arrive as a normal raid rather than as bounded defenders. Small chance they drop right on top of your pawns in a smaller group. Only fires while the map's faction is hostile. -->
  <BTG_Settings_ResupplyTriggersRaidDesc>補給の要請が成功した時,守備隊の派閥による増援のドロップポッド襲撃も発生し,あなたのキャラクターを狙います.増援は行動範囲を制限された防衛部隊ではなく,通常の襲撃として現れます.低い確率で,少人数のまま真上に降下してくることがあります.マップの派閥が敵対している間のみ発生します.</BTG_Settings_ResupplyTriggersRaidDesc>

  <!-- ========== CARGO VAULT HATCH ========== -->
  <!-- EN: Relock cargo vault -->
  <BTG_CargoVaultHatch_RelockLabel>貨物保管庫を再施錠</BTG_CargoVaultHatch_RelockLabel>
  <!-- EN: Relock the cargo vault. Contents will be returned to station inventory. -->
  <BTG_CargoVaultHatch_RelockDesc>貨物保管庫を再び施錠します.中身はステーションの在庫に戻されます.</BTG_CargoVaultHatch_RelockDesc>

